<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ryan's Family cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ryan's Family cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Interstate Johnson/Lane said it downgraded Ryan's Family Steak Houses to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 7-1/4 in midmorning exchange trade.</p>
</text>
